WEBVTT

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:11.387
Tie up and tie up and tie up your hair,

00:05:11.411 --> 00:05:12.813
throw back those curls.

00:05:12.837 --> 00:05:15.103
Tie up and tie up your hair,

00:05:15.127 --> 00:05:16.956
throw back those curls, uh ...

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:18.130
Throw back those curls,

00:05:18.154 --> 00:05:20.657
throw back and throw back
and throw back those curls.

00:05:20.681 --> 00:05:22.863
(Beatboxing)

00:05:24.589 --> 00:05:25.922
Amber G.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:29.433
(Applause and cheers)

00:05:29.457 --> 00:05:30.679
Top knot turn up.